UID:dace22fd1d89923b82584fd679728ded9152026_12:39:01_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Explore SILC programs and study abroad: Advising pop-up
LOCATION:Durham Hall first floor, 851 S. Cady Mall, Tempe, AZ 85287, United States
URL:https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=414303
DESCRIPTION:Want to globalize your degree?\nStop by to talk with an advisor about how global language and culture studies can fit into your academic plan and support your personal and professional goals. Whether you’re just starting to explore or already considering a specific program, our advisors can help you understand your options or how to balance a SILC program alongside your current major. \n\nGet personalized guidance, ask questions and see how a SILC major, minor, certificate or global education experience (such as study abroad or a global internship) could fit into your academic journey.\n---\nEvent Details: https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=414303
END:VEVENT
