UID:f56130e05c02704192e96bcbc40559c59242026_3:44:36_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Student Success Center-Pop Up Event-Slime Making
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=415620
DESCRIPTION:🫧 Slime & Unwind Pop-Up! 🌈✨\n\nCome de-stress, get creative, and make your own custom slime! 💛 Students can choose their favorite colors, textures, scents, and fun mix-ins to create a slime that’s uniquely theirs 🎨🫧.\n\nThis hands-on activity offers a fun way to step away from the stress of classes, relax, and enjoy a little nostalgia 🌿. While you mix and create, connect with fellow Sun Devils 🤝 and chat with Student Success Coaches 💬 in a relaxed and welcoming environment.\n\nWhether you’re looking to unwind, meet new people, or simply have some fun, stop by to spark conversations, build connections, and leave with your own personalized slime creation! ✨💚\n\nThis is for any ASU students interested in joining! Pop-Up Coaching is a tabling event that promotes the Student Success Center, and students who stop by can receive on-the-spot coaching from our Peer Coaches.\n\n👉 Learn more at success.asu.edu\n---\nEvent Details: https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=415620
END:VEVENT
