UID:bcea339151cabc2854fbdf476ff32e75812026_5:24:38_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Tuesday Forum: If God, Why Evil?
LOCATION:Hayden Library Study Rooms (C13), 300 E Orange St., Tempe, AZ 85281, United States
URL:https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=406708
DESCRIPTION:How can a loving God allow so much evil? Join us as we explore the problem of evil through Dr. Norm Geisler's thoughtful book, If God, Why Evil? People of all perspectives are welcome to the group and should feel free to disagree with the author. Every student who joins gets a free copy of the book. To join, please RSVP.\n---\nEvent Details: https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=406708
END:VEVENT
