UID:b307afb7400ce81a3a6240bb6a1c68189162026_9:18:10_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Poetry and Picnic
LOCATION:Durham Hall, Outdoor Patio, 851 S Cady Mall Tempe AZ 85287
URL:https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=414630
DESCRIPTION:Bring a picnic lunch and join the Poetry from Many Worlds Initiative and the Bilingual Press | Editorial Bilingüe for a collaborative poetry- and place-making picnic during Humanities Week at ASU.\n\nParticipants will receive a vintage Bilingual Press | Editorial Bilingüe book of poetry and a pre-stamped postcard inviting them to reflect through words and/or images on how and where they have experienced poetry across the ASU campus. Returned postcards will become part of a curated artist book to be unveiled at the next Poetry from Many Worlds event on February 11, 2027.\n\nPoetry prompts will also be available for participants to write their own poetry.\n---\nEvent Details: https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=414630
END:VEVENT
