UID:ec3444d664a9d5657ea8945f8a29ccb79232026_12:50:55_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Coloring Through Mirrors 
LOCATION:UCB 261, 1151 S Forest Ave, Tempe, AZ 85281, United States
URL:https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=415461
DESCRIPTION:Coloring Through Mirrors is a fun, hands-on event where students can take a break from studying and try a simple dental-related activity. Participants will use dental mirrors to color and complete drawings while only looking through the mirror, giving them a chance to practice hand-eye coordination and experience how dentists work with indirect vision. The event is meant to bring students together, introduce them to a small part of dentistry, and give Pre-Dental Association members a fun way to connect with each other. It will improve the ASU student experience by creating a relaxed, interactive activity where students can meet others with similar interests while learning something new about dentistry.\n---\nEvent Details: https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=415461
END:VEVENT
