UID:219df63f6dd45e1bf521a6d7c4eaa6479162026_9:39:32_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Global Doors: Opportunities in Spanish and Portuguese
LOCATION:Durham Hall, First Floor, 851 S Cady Mall Tempe AZ 85287
URL:https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=414633
DESCRIPTION:Discover how your language skills open global doors!\n\nAt this dynamic career fair hosted by the School of International Letters and Cultures, Spanish, Portuguese and Brazilian Studies students will connect with professionals from diverse industries. Students will explore internships, job opportunities and graduate programs where multilingual and cross-cultural communication skills are in high demand. \n\nThis event is designed to help you see how your language and cultural expertise can translate into real-world impact and meaningful careers, both in the U.S. and abroad.\n---\nEvent Details: https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=414633
END:VEVENT
