UID:7bbe51eb85a2b5a15e2e994f2de097bc8132026_7:34:40_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:GCI Career Hour
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=408560
DESCRIPTION:Join us every Tuesday from 2:00–3:00 PM at the SSV Amphitheater for Career Happy Hour, a casual drop-in session designed to help you navigate your career journey and connect with helpful resources. During the first 30 minutes, Career Services staff will highlight career resources, job search tools, upcoming opportunities, and practical tips for student success. The second half of the session is \ndedicated to open Q&A, where you can ask questions about resumes, job searches, networking, internships, career planning, and more. \nWhether you're just getting started or actively searching for opportunities, Career Happy Hour is a great place to learn, ask questions, and  get personalized support in a relaxed setting. No registration required, just stop by and join the conversation!"\n---\nEvent Details: https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=408560
END:VEVENT
