UID:b6f42e00418857524fa7155da2a4aa7710132026_6:06:33_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Student Success Center-Pop Up Event- Leave a Note, Take a Note
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=417277
DESCRIPTION:💌 Take a Note, Leave a Note Pop-Up! ✨💛\n\nNeed a little encouragement—or have some positivity to share? 🌟 Students can stop by to leave an uplifting note for another Sun Devil and take a note that inspires them in return 📝💕\n\nThis simple activity creates a positive space to slow down, de-stress, and brighten someone else’s day 🌿. It’s also a great way to support emotional and social wellness while reminding students that a few kind words can go a long way 🤝✨.\n\nWhile you’re there, connect with Student Success Coaches 💬, share some positivity, and help us build a supportive and encouraging ASU community 🔱💛.\n\nThis is for any ASU students interested in joining! Pop-Up Coaching is a tabling event that promotes the Student Success Center, and students who stop by can receive on-the-spot coaching from our Peer Coaches.\n\n👉 Learn more at success.asu.edu\n---\nEvent Details: https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=417277
END:VEVENT
