UID:a755311f5ade87304e3a9448432976eb1022026_12:31:45_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:AI and Multilingualism Lab
LOCATION:Durham Hall, Room 132, 851 S Cady Mall Tempe AZ 85287
URL:https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=416437
DESCRIPTION:Curious about how artificial intelligence is changing the way we learn and use languages? \nLearn about ASU’s new AI and Multilingualism Lab to discover how AI, language and culture come together. \n\nExplore the lab’s research in multilingual communication and AI-powered language learning, discover AI-tools designed for language learning, and engage in conversation with our experts about the future of AI in multilingualism practices. \n\nThis interactive experience offers a look at the lab’s current projects, research opportunities and the connection between global language and technology. \n---\nEvent Details: https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=416437
END:VEVENT
