DESCRIPTION:Enjoy a cozy fall evening in ASU’s Secret Garden with Paint Your 3D Figurine! Choose a 3D-printed figurine and bring it to life with your own colors and creativity while relaxing outdoors in the beautiful fall weather. Enjoy food, meet new people, and spend the evening painting and hanging out in one of ASU’s most unique hidden spots. No painting experience needed!\n---\nEvent Details: https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=415670
