SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Newman Social
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=416297
DESCRIPTION:The Newman Club at ASU is requesting space at the GLCC to host an evening social event for members of the Greek community (fraternities and sororities). The event is designed to build connections between Newman Club and Greek life, giving students a relaxed setting to meet one another, get to know our organization, and learn about upcoming Newman Club programming.\n\nWe are requesting the space on Tuesday, October 27 (with Tuesday, October 20 as an alternate date), from approximately 5:30 PM to 8:30ish. We expect around 100 attendees. The event will include food and refreshments, music, and informal social activities; setup and cleanup will be handled by our student leadership team. The event is funded through our organization's budget.\n---\nEvent Details: https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=416297
END:VEVENT
