UID:a1672e31eee5a94470df52b0d5fa8e1d8272026_6:54:01_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:HBSA Networking Night
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=412038
DESCRIPTION:HBSA’s Networking Night is designed to bring students, professionals, alumni, faculty, and community partners together in an engaging environment focused on building meaningful professional connections. Unlike a traditional company presentation or General Meeting, this event provides students with the opportunity to interact with representatives from a variety of industries and organizations throughout the evening.\n\nAttendees will participate in an open networking environment, allowing students to meet representatives from multiple companies, learn about different career paths and industries, and develop their professional networks. Structured networking activities and conversation prompts will also be incorporated throughout the event to encourage attendees to meet new people and make meaningful connections.\n\nStudents are encouraged to come prepared with a brief introduction, dress professionally, and take advantage of the opportunity to ask questions about career experiences, industries, internships, and professional development. The event will also provide an opportunity for students to connect with HBSA alumni and existing corporate and community partners outside of traditional professional settings.\n\nFood and refreshments will be provided throughout the event, creating a welcoming atmosphere for students and professionals to connect and engage with one another. Through a combination of professional networking and community building, Networking Night aims to strengthen connections between HBSA students and the broader professional community.\n---\nEvent Details: https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=412038
END:VEVENT
