LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=412311
DESCRIPTION:Sun Devil Rocketry is collaborating with several other Aerospace related technical clubs at ASU to host a networking event to allow club members to talk to engineers in industry on their professional experience, and to get career advice, primarily resume feedback. This event will function as a sit down with engineers, with engineering students getting the opportunity to sit down and talk with engineers, with catering being provided.\n---\nEvent Details: https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=412311
