UID:24a79b0be3184204f33f7653f206beac9182026_2:31:39_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Stage Fright
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=414791
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a night of spooky competition, good food, and fun at Stage Fright! Grab your friends and come show off your skills in our Lip Sync Battle, compete for the best-looking costume contest, and put your horror knowledge to the test with Horror Trivia. \n\nWant something more chill? Paint your own mini pumpkin and take it home with you! Of course, come hungry — we’ll have food available throughout the event. Whether you’re coming to compete, dress up, paint, eat, or just watch the chaos, Stage Fright is the perfect way to celebrate spooky season on campus! Bring your friends, bring your best costume, and get ready for a frightfully fun night!\n---\nEvent Details: https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=414791
END:VEVENT
