UID:818f4b14eaf63bc07ff278ce42a0d43510142026_12:02:49_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:General Body Meeting #5
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=417319
DESCRIPTION:Join us for GBM 5 as we learn the basics of 3D modeling using CAD software! We’ll explore how to turn ideas into 3D designs and apply these skills to our projects. Afterward, we’ll have dedicated team work time to collaborate, brainstorm, and make progress on our ongoing projects. 💡\n\nWhether you’re new to CAD or ready to build on your skills, this is a great opportunity to learn something new and work together to create meaningful, accessible solutions! ♿️✨\n\nWe can’t wait to see you all there!\n---\nEvent Details: https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=417319
END:VEVENT
