UID:758726634c93d32802fbd9ec7973d802912026_3:31:04_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Sun Devil Quizbowl Weekly Meeting
LOCATION:Durham Hall room 203, 851 S Cady Mall, Tempe, AZ 85287, United States
URL:https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=412627
DESCRIPTION:We meet weekly to play "quizbowl", a game similar to the game show Jeopardy, in which players compete to quickly "buzz in" to answer a question being read aloud by a moderator. These questions can range anywhere from chemistry to history to Star Wars, and we often pick categories based on the interests of whoever is present at our meetings.\nOur meetings are beginner friendly and casual. Feel free to stop by anytime; bring your friends!\n\nMeeting Link: https://discord.gg/gVtgf4TeN2\n---\nEvent Details: https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=412627
END:VEVENT
