SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Honors Halloween
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=415501
DESCRIPTION:Come join us at the Barrett Complex for Honors Halloween! 🎃 Show up and go all out in your best costume while enjoying a night full of Halloween activities. Grab some candy, sing your heart out at karaoke, play volleyball and bingo, watch a spooky movie, and make Boo Grams for the people you love. Come celebrate Halloween for a night of costumes, games, treats, and fun! \n---\nEvent Details: https://sundevilcentral.eoss.asu.edu/rsvp?id=415501
